# Witness rows for the local binary kernel of J₄

These untrusted tables record the two outputs of the ATLAS program
`J4G1-max1W1` and eleven successive conjugates of `(xy)^14`.
The conjugate words are specified in `conjugates` in `KernelCount.BinarySpan`
(in namespace `Janko4.Cardinality.KernelCount`). Every row uses bit j for
column j, as in `Model.Data`. Merely defining these rows asserts no matrix
identity, order, or independence. Certificate modules must check those facts
with the proved packed multiplication interface.

Source: https://brauer.maths.qmul.ac.uk/Atlas/spor/J4/words/J4G1-max1W1 .
-/

